  "summary": "SUDDENICON is a payload delivered in a supply chain attack targeting users of the 3CXDesktopApp. A trojanized ffmpeg.dll loads SUDDENICON from another malicious DLL (d3dcompiler_47.dll) using a static RC4 key. The malware then contacts C2 domains, which are decoded from icon files hosted on GitHub, to download a second-stage infostealer.",
